{"timestamp": 1779348344.8479135, "event_type": "free_roam_chat", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "name": "Charlie", "room": "weapons", "message": "Just passing through Diana, heading to oxygen!", "tick": 10}}
{"timestamp": 1779348350.785295, "event_type": "body_reported", "tick": 10, "data": {"caller": "player_4", "reason": "Eve reported a dead body", "bodies": [{"room": "electrical", "victim_name": "Alice"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1779348350.786142, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 10, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779348357.6245463, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I found Alice's body in electrical. I started in storage, went up to medbay, and then headed over to electrical where I tripped over her. The only person I saw on my way was Frank, who was leaving medbay and heading towards storage earlier. Does anyone else have information on who was near electrical recently?"}}
{"timestamp": 1779348367.528934, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I've been isolated on the left side of the ship this entire round. I started in upper engine, went up to oxygen to work on a task, and then headed back down to upper engine. I haven't seen a single person yet, so I unfortunately can't vouch for anyone or offer any clues about what happened to Alice in electrical. \n\nSince I've been completely alone on the left, it seems like most people were clustered around the middle or right side of the map. Let's hear what Frank has to say about Eve's timeline, and find out where Charlie and Diana were while all this was happening. I'll listen to the rest of you before deciding how to vote."}}
{"timestamp": 1779348376.416742, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I started my route in navigation, moved up to security, and then headed to weapons. While I was in security, I actually saw Charlie walk in directly from electrical, and then he followed me up to weapons. \n\nSince Eve just found Alice's body in electrical, the fact that Charlie came straight from there makes him highly suspicious. Charlie, you need to explain exactly what you were doing in electrical and why you left right before Eve found the body. Right now, Charlie is my top suspect, but let's hear what he and Frank have to say."}}
{"timestamp": 1779348390.3611274, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "Eve is completely right about our passing in Medbay. My route was Medbay, a quick check into Electrical, back to Medbay, and then down to Storage. \n\nWhen I poked my head into Electrical early in the round, I actually saw Alice and Charlie in there together. I figured they were just doing tasks, so I left them to it and headed back out. Diana, your information is the smoking gun here\u2014if you saw Charlie leaving Electrical right after he was in there with Alice, he has to be the Duck. He was the last person with her before he bailed towards Security. \n\nEverything lines up perfectly against Charlie. I'm voting for him."}}
{"timestamp": 1779348408.3205402, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I know this looks bad for me, but everyone needs to listen carefully because Frank is lying about his timeline to frame me! \n\nYes, Diana is absolutely right\u2014I came from electrical to security, and then I followed her to weapons where we were together when the meeting was called. I have nothing to hide about my route. \n\nBut Frank's story about just \"poking his head in\" to electrical is a complete lie. Frank was already in electrical when the round started. At tick 3, Alice walked into electrical from the cafeteria. Frank, Alice, and I were all in electrical together at tick 4. After that, I left electrical and headed straight to security, which is exactly when Diana saw me. \n\nThat means I left Frank alone in electrical with Alice! He didn't leave us to it; I left him with her! He killed her after I walked away, and now he's using Diana's completely accurate sighting of me to construct a frame job. \n\nVote for Frank! He's the Duck."}}
